{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_fartth_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_fartth_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"容身之所","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_fartth_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"73ad200646aad9a130fe599ed4a333963c8effe6f257567fe43f62a19f3d24ed","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"“你會回來？真的？當上騎士就回來？”\n“……那就這麼說定了。我們都等著你榮歸故里，到時我們就到處去宣傳，這裡可是騎士查絲汀娜的故鄉！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的……故鄉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天真的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天真的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒在村子裡見過你，你是外鄉來的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我出生在這裡，後來去了大騎士領。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天真的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"大騎士領！難道姐姐你是一名騎士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天真的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"肯定沒錯，這副盔甲比休伯特用木板做的漂亮多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天真的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"可以讓我看看你的弩箭嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"和善的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"米倫！不要纏著人家！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"和善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"真是抱歉小姐，這孩子最近迷上了騎士小說，一見生人就問個不停。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"和善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"您……看起來有點眼熟……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丹卡嬸嬸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹卡嬸嬸","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"……查絲汀娜？你真的回來了……啊，現在應該叫你“遠牙騎士”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹卡嬸嬸","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"我們從報紙上看到了你取得封號的消息，大家都為你高興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹卡嬸嬸","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"你還記得柯爾叔叔嗎？他把你的每條新聞都剪下來貼在牆上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹卡嬸嬸","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你贏了比賽，他就會額外開一瓶酒為你慶祝——雖然我們都覺得他只是為自己的貪杯找藉口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹卡嬸嬸","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"不過……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹卡嬸嬸","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"你生病了……這還是我們從報紙上看到的，村裡的人都很擔心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的病情控制得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹卡嬸嬸","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好，那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹卡嬸嬸","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？米倫，你手裡拿的是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"騎士姐姐的箭匣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹卡嬸嬸","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"別碰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹卡嬸嬸","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"……我是說把它還給遠牙騎士，這是很貴重的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹卡嬸嬸","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"就算不會傷人也很危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我考慮不周。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丹卡嬸嬸","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"遠牙騎士，您要進村坐坐嗎？大家都很想念您，只是我需要先去通知一聲……做些準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"發什麼呆啊，遠牙騎士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者轉移之後要先清點人數。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……二組全員到齊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（什麼時候數的……明明看起來在發呆啊？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有沒有人看到小佐拉？她去哪裡了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"出什麼事了，法洛恩老師？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法洛恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來以為小佐拉只是對新的聚集區好奇，出去探險了，但她到現在都沒回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"從第九住宅區轉移過來的時候有沒有人看見她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法洛恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒注意……那時候天色還沒亮，我光顧著給腿腳受傷的同鄉引路……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"別太擔心，我們會找到她的，但需要先縮小搜尋範圍，兩個區塊之間隔了不少建築設施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索娜……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可能知道那個孩子去了哪裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_oldwarehouse_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"一天前"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"又見到你們了，我的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"這是半年來的第幾次了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"第四次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在這片廢棄廠區待得算久的啦，距離上次轉移足足過了三個月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"有一次可是剛落腳沒幾天就被無胄盟找上門了。自從那次以後我收拾行李都只用兩個包袱，方便隨時跑路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……索娜也在找適合長住的地方，現在只能委屈你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"這也不是你們的錯。我們現在還能在大騎士領生活，全靠紅松騎士團接濟。再說了，感染者又能在哪裡歇腳呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還在移動地塊邊緣流浪的時候就已經習慣了，只是小佐拉有些不高興，早上還跟法洛恩老師吵了一架。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"……商業聯合會的清剿決策還在收緊，除了商業地塊之外，居民區也不如之前安全了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"之前有騎士在附近街道看到無胄盟巡邏的跡象，雖然人員不多，但是個值得警戒的訊號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我說，我們直接幹掉巡邏小隊，告訴那群董事這裡就是紅松騎士團的地盤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"然後讓他們順理成章地趁我們人手不足炸毀工廠？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"查絲汀娜，你覺得呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……只是座廢棄工廠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是！到時候在附近另找個地方——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不是家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的家已經毀在天災之中，現在應該轉移到更安全的地方，讓更多的人活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遠牙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我們現在還沒有跟商業聯合會正面對抗的能力，或許有一天我們會有自己的地塊，讓所有大騎士領的感染者都有家可回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"明天一早出發。小灰和我最熟悉路線規劃，我們領隊。艾沃娜負責掃清障礙，查絲汀娜負責偵察援護。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"至於今天晚上——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來守夜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_oldwarehouse_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……佐拉？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前幾天這條小路還沒有巡邏的黑衣人啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，再繞路的話我要遲到了，只能……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你在這裡做什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟殺手","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上不能離開聚集區，很危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"查絲汀娜姐姐……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我送你回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不行。麗塔還在等我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗塔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請不要告訴法洛恩老師，如果他知道我和居民區的孩子交朋友，他一定會生氣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是麗塔真的不是壞人。她不在意我的病，還誇我很會畫畫……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"查絲汀娜姐姐，我們為什麼三不五時就要換地方住？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要把身體包起來，我就跟普通人沒什麼差別。麗塔帶我進過商店，沒有人發現我生了病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的不想再走了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"村子被毀掉之後，我們只能在荒地上兜圈子，剩下的食物也越來越少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是法洛恩老師找到了索娜姐姐，我們才能進入大騎士領。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我們好像還是四處流浪，只是從地上變到地下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慢慢地，我開始記不清村頭的樹叢結的是哪種莓果，以前我很愛吃的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果村子還在，我們就不需要像現在這樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者能回到哪裡去……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，你的家也被天災毀了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，那座村莊自建成以來從未受過災害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真好……它在哪裡？景色漂亮嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在北部森林和平原的交界地帶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡……確實是個很美的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我吧，查絲汀娜姐姐！你的家鄉是什麼樣子的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下次吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟殺手","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"誰在那裡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……第三支巡邏小隊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通訊器中的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……巡邏小隊請回覆……是否需要增援……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們必須走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我還沒跟麗塔道別……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法洛恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我提醒過她，不要跟非感染者的孩子在一起玩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"聚集區裡沒有同齡的孩子，小佐拉難免會想找個朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"無胄盟可不會在意她是不是孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"她是名感染者。對他們而言幼小代表的不是可愛天真，而是易於“清掃”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法洛恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"查絲汀娜，關於佐拉的猜測，你有多大把握？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我不能確定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"撤離第九區時我們已經打草驚蛇，現在倉庫可能正被無胄盟把守，無論是偵察員還是突擊隊，人數只會多不會少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"除了這個區塊的感染者，我們還需要為另一批災民提供安全保障，他們今天剛移動到大騎士領邊緣，正等待我們救援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_oldwarehouse_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟殺手A","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛聽到那間儲藏室裡有點動靜，要不要過去看一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟殺手B","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"廢棄倉庫有些骯髒的小動物也很正常，我才不要進去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"儲藏室……是佐拉之前畫畫的地方！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"綠色……紅色的飄帶……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，對……還有黃色，跟她的眼睛一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……箭匣上也有花紋，裡面有很多發亮的弩箭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐的箭很準，只要射出一支，就、就能把黑衣人都嚇跑……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用怕……不用怕……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狙擊鏡的位置不太對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是放那麼前面，我就射不準了啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"查絲汀娜姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚……對不起……我只是想來拿送給麗塔的道別禮物……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算不能送出去，我也想自己留下……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"會再見面的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先從這裡出去……你還走得動嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"藏進來的時候我的腳扭了一下……對不起姐姐……我好害怕……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係的，不需要道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……閉上眼睛，佐拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的家鄉，昨天你問我它是什麼樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉上眼睛，我說給你聽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"31_g3_mini12_farmland"},{"type":"narration","text":"]"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什麼聲音……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"查絲汀娜姐姐你還好嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要睜開眼睛，我沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"振翅的小蟲伏在穗上，收穫的鐮刀揮過，牠躍進泥土。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有風。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風的旋律是柯爾叔叔常吹的那支小調，柔軟地撫過耳畔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是我的……家。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_oldwarehouse_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（增援的人手來得太快，很難從正門帶佐拉離開……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟殺手","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼聲音？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通訊器中的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們遇襲了，這裡果然就是那群感染者騎士窩藏難民的據點，提高警惕！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（……想想辦法，團體賽的時候也是一對多……）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……野鬃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"調用這麼大規模的殺手小隊駐守廢棄倉庫，商業聯合會什麼時候也會做虧本買賣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟殺手","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"就一個人還想跟我們作對……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟殺手","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，多一個幫手也——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"你衝得太前面了，野鬃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"騎槍的使命就是深入敵軍，分割戰場，這是戰術！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"那制定計劃的意義在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"計劃趕不上變化嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"小灰的意思是你離我們的陣形太遠，她的盾沒辦法保護你啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"……我沒這麼說！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不是來接人的嗎，查絲汀娜去哪裡了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"在那裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"查絲汀娜，你猜得真準，小佐拉果然在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們……謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"太客氣了，查絲汀娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"其餘的騎士已經去救助新的夥伴了，我們本來就打算留下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰能想到你衝得比我還快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我們沒聊過幾句，但現在我還蠻喜歡你的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十一點鐘、兩點鐘方向有增援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"小灰——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"對方站位太過分散，我的彈藥不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交給我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟殺手","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"對方有狙擊手！聚攏陣形，別被逐個擊破！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"漂亮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正面出口打開。駐守工廠的無胄盟殺手都已經被打趴下啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"通訊裝置處理完畢，短時間內不會有更多追兵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小佐拉？你可以睜開眼睛啦，錯過這樣一場大戰實在可惜，不過你還是小孩子嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"風聲不對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"查絲汀娜？你怎麼了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟殺手","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哇，好險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我完全沒意識到樓上還藏著一個狙擊手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"查絲汀娜，你怎麼發現他的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽不見風的聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……那裡有扇窗戶，風會影響箭的軌跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜你也沒聽明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈……過段時間你們就能適應查絲汀娜的說話風格啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"佐拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"查絲汀娜姐姐……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經沒有危險了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們回家。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“滴滴”——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_oldwarehouse_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“正義騎士號”","speakerId":"avg_4000_jnight_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（疑惑的滴滴聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是野鬃的……寵物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“正義騎士號”","speakerId":"avg_4000_jnight_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（歡快的滴滴聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“正義騎士號”","speakerId":"avg_4000_jnight_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（響亮的滴滴聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等、等一下……大家會被吵醒的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開關……開關在哪裡……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開關在擋板後面哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我不建議你關掉她。突然接收不到周圍的訊息，正義號會很寂寞的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你喜歡跟人待在一起，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“正義騎士號”","speakerId":"avg_4000_jnight_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（歡快的滴滴聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？查絲汀娜……什麼東西的聲音……從沒聽過……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我的口笛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來你還會吹笛子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦……我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是想要聽眾才讓正義號叫人來的，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這下你可找對人了！雖然不太懂音樂，但我是名非常優秀的觀眾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請開始你的演奏吧，遠牙騎士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是喜歡湊熱鬧吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾納蒂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是被正義號叫醒的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"我是被你吵醒的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你得感謝我，查絲汀娜正準備為我們演奏曲子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"別為難查絲汀娜……這是口笛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"在家鄉，我認識一位腿腳不方便的老奶奶，她總在屋子裡吹曲子，用的就是這種自製樂器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……確實有些懷念以前常聽的民謠小調了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"你們背著我偷偷來樓頂聚會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"虧我念在救援行動比較辛苦的份上，還想讓你們多睡一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"你也被吵醒了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我在想小佐拉的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"艾沃娜之前說得對，在地下躲藏並非長久之計。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"大家習慣了顛沛流離的生活，逐漸忘記感染者也應該有自己的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"既然都醒著，下來陪我聊聊，我有了一個新想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，那演奏……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下次，艾沃娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下次吹給你們聽，我家鄉的曲子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
